# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored — never commit real values.
#
# Vertex AI, via an application-default login plus a project-scoped regional endpoint.
# See content/bin/vertex.py for why express-mode API keys no longer work.
#
#     gcloud auth application-default login
#
GCP_PROJECT=your-gcp-project-id
GCP_LOCATION=us-central1

# Legacy express-mode key. Kept because vertex.available() still falls back to it,
# but the ADC path above is the one that works.
AGENT_GCP_KEY=

# Optional: OpenAI, if you run generate_stills.py --provider openai
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stripe
#
# All four are required together: `settings.stripe_configured` is false unless every
# one is set, and `POST /billing/checkout` then refuses naming exactly which are
# missing rather than creating a checkout that 404s at Stripe.
#
# The free tier needs none of these. Sign-in and the whole console work without
# Stripe entirely; only the two paid plans need it.
#
# `billing.py` refuses anything but a test key, deliberately — this code has never
# taken a payment, and a live key here would make the first one an accident. The
# mode is read off the key's own prefix, so there is no second flag to disagree with.
#
# To fill these in:
#
#   1. STRIPE_SECRET_KEY — from the Stripe dashboard in *test mode*, starts sk_test_
#   2. the two price ids — create them from the tiers rather than by hand:
#
#        cd platform/web
#        STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_... .venv/bin/python ../bin/stripe_setup.py
#
#      It prints the ids to paste below. It is idempotent (prices are keyed by tier
#      and amount) and it never writes this file.
#   3. STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET — from the endpoint you point at POST /billing/webhook,
#      starts whsec_. An unset one refuses every webhook, which is correct: an
#      unverified billing webhook is an unauthenticated way to grant paid plans.
#      For local work, `stripe listen --forward-to localhost:8000/billing/webhook`
#      prints one.
#
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
STRIPE_PRICE_LABEL=
STRIPE_PRICE_ROSTER=
